# Build context for the root Dockerfile is the whole repo — keep it lean and
# keep secrets out of it. macOS AppleDouble/.DS_Store cruft is excluded here
# too: it once got tar-transferred to the NAS and broke Alembic's migration
# loader (a "*.py" file it isn't), so it must never end up inside an image
# either.

.git
.github

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/.DS_Store
**/._*

docs
*.md
!README.md
